  "text": "You can fling a portion of your magic at foes. You gain a ranged unarmed attack in the sling weapon group with a maximum range of 20 feet that deals 1d4 damage. The damage type and name of the unarmed attack depend on your heritage, described below; most sprite heritages not presented in this book also use luminous spark.\n- Dijiang primordial pulse (spirit)\n\n- Draxie euphoric spark (mental)\n\n- Firefly or Murxie luminous spark (fire)\n\n- Gandharva celestial song (sonic)\n\n- Kanchil puzzling bolt (mental)\n\n- Kaztili cruel word (sonic)\n\n- Kirakor sour note (sonic)\n\n- Leungli surging splash (mental)\n\n- Melixie sting shot (poison)\n\n- Nyktera ultrasonic pulse (sonic)\n\n- Pixie pixie dust (mental)\n\n- Veredram thorny barb (piercing)",
